         ENTRY SCRMENU                                                  CPW06250
SCRMENU  DC    A(0,0)         NO OTHER CHAINS.                          CPW06260
MENU     DS    CL1920                                                   CPW06270
         ORG   MENU                                                     CPW06280
M1       DC    CL80' '                                                  CPW06290
M2       DC    CL80'CPWATCH &V..&M MENU '                               CPW06300
M3       DC    CL80' '                                                  CPW06310
