               ame order.'                                              CPW06470
M17      DC    CL80' PF8    SYMX         CP/370 System Synonym Table, a+CPW06480
               ddress order.'                                           CPW06490
M18      DC    CL80' '                                                  CPW06500
M19      DC    CL80' PF12   CLOCK        Digital Clock Display.'        CPW06510
M20      DC    CL80' '                                                  CPW06520
M21      DC    CL80'ENTER                Go To Next Screen.'            CPW06530
M22      DC    CL80' '                                                  CPW06540
M23      DC    CL80' (Use the Enter Key with the Command Form.)'        CPW06550
M24      DC    CL80' '                                                  CPW06560
         ORG                                                            CPW06570
         SPACE 3                                                        CPW06580
         ORG   M2+L'M2-25                                               CPW06590
CPWDSPDT DC    CL25'ASSEMBLED &SYSDATE &SYSTIME'                        CPW06600
         ORG                                                            CPW06610
         EJECT                                                          CPW06620
SCRCLOCK DC    A(0,0)                                                   CPW06630
